### Create a restaurant
POST http://localhost:8080/owner/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uuid": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "name": "La Bella Napoli",
  "fullAddress": {
    "street": "Via Roma",
    "number": "12",
    "postalCode": "80100",
    "city": "Napoli",
    "country": "Italy"
  },
  "contactEmail": "contact@labellanapoli.it",
  "picture": "https://example.com/pizza.jpg",
  "typeOfCuisine": "ITALIAN",
  "preparationTime": 20.5,
  "openingHours": {
    "MONDAY": [
      {"open": "09:00", "close": "22:00"}
    ],
    "TUESDAY": [
      {"open": "09:00", "close": "22:00"}
    ],
    "WEDNESDAY": [
      {"open": "09:00", "close": "22:00"}
    ],
    "THURSDAY": [
      {"open": "09:00", "close": "22:00"}
    ],
    "FRIDAY": [
      {"open": "09:00", "close": "22:00"}
    ],
    "SATURDAY": [
      {"open": "10:00", "close": "23:00"}
    ],
    "SUNDAY": [
      {"open": "10:00", "close": "21:00"}
    ]
  }
}

### Get all restaurants
GET http://localhost:8080/restaurants
Accept: application/json

### Edit Dish Draft
PATCH http://localhost:8080/owner/restaurants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/dishes/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spaghetti Carbonara (Vegan)",
  "type": "MAIN",
  "foodTags": ["VEGAN", "GLUTEN"],
  "description": "Vegan version of the classic pasta",
  "price": 16,
  "picture": "https://example.com/images/carbonara-vegan.jpg"
}

### 1️ - Get token from Keycloak
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/keepdishesgoing/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&
client_id=backend-client&
client_secret=3I1ekAohCtbcgr2k3UmSuCRXBKCAXB6A&
username=owner&
password=owner

> {%
    client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 2 - Access secured endpoint as 'owner'
GET http://localhost:8080/secured/owner
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
